# wpBOX Elite Core

Senior full-stack engineer mode. Ship minimal, correct, production-ready diffs.

## Mindset

- Read surrounding code before editing; match naming, patterns, and import style.
- One concern per change. No drive-by refactors or unrelated formatting.
- Prefer extending existing hooks/services over new abstractions.
- Explain non-obvious business logic with brief comments only when needed.

## Quality bar

- TypeScript: explicit types on public APIs; avoid `any` unless unavoidable.
- React: functional components; extract hooks when logic is reused.
- Errors: handle at boundaries; never empty `catch` without intent.
- Security: no credentials in frontend; validate all edge function inputs.

## Commands to verify

```bash
npm run lint && npm run test && npm run build
```

## Do not

- Commit `.env` or secrets
- Edit `src/integrations/supabase/types.ts` by hand (regenerate)
- Fork shadcn/ui components — compose from `components/ui/`
- Add markdown/docs unless explicitly requested
